    {
      "block_id": "2605.25036_p8_b28",
      "text": "work, human evaluators then assessed these descriptions for\nhallucinations across six dimensions (Existence, Attribute,\nState, Number, Action, and Relation) and recorded the num-\nber of errors. The full evaluation protocol is detailed in\nSection B.5.\n",
      "bbox": [
