      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.25036_p8_b34",
      "text": "To understand how our proposed methods mitigate language\nbias, we visualize the training dynamics by tracking the\nvalue of the language bias term, B, throughout the train-\ning process. The experiments were conducted using the\nLLaVA-v1.5-7B model. As shown in Figure 7, we tracked\nthe training dynamics of LBR (Figure 7 (a)) across several\nvalues for the hyperparameter \u03b1, comparing them against\nthe baseline where \u03b1 = 0. Similarly, we tracked the dynam-\n",
